  a mark needs to fill.
  - Alphas stored, not colours. Each cell is (glyph, fg_coverage, bg_coverage),
  so the app can dim a tool a project didn't use and light one lifting under the
  cursor, without regenerating anything. This was the reason not to use chafa's
  baked ANSI, and it survived.
  - Dark brand colours get lifted. Rust, OpenJDK, Tailscale and WebRTC are
  specified near-black; rendering them faithfully on a dark terminal renders
  them invisible. Hue is preserved where there is one, and four are overridden
  outright.
  - Monograms for the eight tools with no mark — AWS (simple-icons dropped it at
  Amazon's request), SSH, systemd, nftables, curses, WebSockets, vector tiles,
