  button held). Works in most terminals; tmux needs set -g mouse on, and some
  setups swallow motion events.
  - A font with the braille block for the mesh threads. DejaVu Sans Mono has it;
  JetBrains Mono and Noto Sans Mono don't and you'll see boxes instead of the
  weave. The logos themselves only need block glyphs, which every font ships.

